            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <sparkle:hardwareRequirements>arm64</sparkle:hardwareRequirements>
            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[# Kiki 0.6.27

- Fixes keyboard focus getting trapped in the Workbench sidebar or on the first page action.
- Makes every visible page control reachable in a predictable order with Tab or macOS all-controls navigation, including reverse movement and scrolling focused controls into view.
]]></description>
